# 🧵 Jhagra Textile & Clothing — Atelier Ledger

An elegant, lightweight Tkinter desktop application for managing garment tailoring orders, customer measurement cards, staff allocations, order finances, and live shop floor execution metrics.

Built with a **neumorphic (soft UI)** design system ported from the JTC web app: raised cards and recessed wells on one warm-grey canvas, tracked uppercase captions, rounded status pills, and a pastel accent palette — in both a Light and a Dark theme, with all chrome living in a single floating sidebar.

---

## ✨ Features

* **Neumorphic UI**: raised cards, inset wells, status pills, and a sage/blush/lavender accent strip on the sidebar. No top bar — the brand and clock live in the sidebar.
* **📊 Analytics Dashboard**: three donut gauges sharing one card, counter tiles (orders / customers / tailors on duty), a Paid / Remaining / Debt finance snapshot with donuts, and an inset-row order ledger with status pills.
* **💰 Finance**: per-bucket donuts on every total card, All / Done / Due filter tabs and an Add Payment form, backed by a local SQLite ledger (`finance.db`) mirrored from the orders spreadsheet.
* **🧠 Remembers your settings**: theme, language, last open section, and window size persist across restarts.
* **👤 Customer Hub**: contact profiles, address, and measurement cards (length, chest, waist, ...).
* **📋 Staff & Task Allocation**: roles, duty status, and tasks linked to real orders.
* **📅 Production Calendar**: month grid of deliveries due per day, with due-this-month / due-in-7-days / overdue counts.
* **📦 Inventory**: stock on hand with a summary strip (items, units, low stock, out of stock) plus stock-in / stock-out.
* **🖼️ Brand imagery**: shop sign as window icon and sidebar logo; owner photo as login backdrop, sidebar background and page watermark.
* **⇄ Right-to-left Urdu**: Urdu/Pashto mirror the entire layout (sidebar right, tables and text right-aligned), not only the words.
* **⚡ Quick controls**: theme and language chips in the sidebar; Ctrl+T flips the theme, Ctrl+G cycles language.
* **📈 System monitor** (optional): internet / CPU / RAM / disk / GPU in the sidebar.
* **🔒 Admin password** change in Settings (bcrypt-hashed).
* **🤖 Command bar** (Ctrl+K, optional): type a section name, theme or language.
* **🗑 Finance delete** for a single ledger row (admin only).
* **🔗 Clickable cards**: every tile opens the page it summarises.
* **💬 WhatsApp** and **🧵 fabric estimate** on the Customers page.
* **🖥️ Full screen by default**, switchable to windowed in Settings (F11 toggles, Esc exits).
* **⚙️ Settings**: theme, language, display mode, garment types, and employee roles in one screen.
* **⏰ Real-time Header Clock**.

