## 🛠️ Project Structure

```text
app/
├── main_gui.py           # Primary Tkinter GUI entry point
├── data/                 # Excel storage (incl. inventory.xlsx), finance.db, session cache
├── Images/               # Shop sign + owner photos used across the UI
├── utils/                # finance_db.py, app_state.py, assets.py, and other helpers
├── lang/                 # Translation dictionaries (en, ur fully done; ps/zh/ru pending)
├── changes/               # Dated changelog entries
├── tests/                 # Unit + GUI smoke tests
└── views/                 # Reusable Tkinter views
README.md                  # Full project documentation
```

