## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

* **Python 3.8+**, with the standard `tkinter` library (bundled on Windows/macOS installers).

> **Linux users**: if `tkinter` isn't installed, `sudo apt-get install python3-tk`.

### Running the Application

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install flask flask-cors openpyxl bcrypt filelock reportlab
python main_gui.py
```

