## ⚙️ Optional Flask Backend

The desktop app is fully self-contained (Excel + SQLite, no server needed). A separate Flask API also exists under `app/routes/` for anyone who wants a REST layer on top of the same data; start it with `python run.py`. It defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:5000/api`.
